# Changing a date written mid-line updates it in place; new date tags go at the end of the line.
file <<END
- Call @due({today}) Bob
Home:
Note text
- Email me@example.com
END
keys } j T j t j W
quit
saved <<END
- Call @due({today+1}) Bob
Home: @due({today})
Note text @start({today})
- Email me@example.com @due({today+1})
END
